# Trust paths: what changes the rules, the pipeline, AWS access or what agents may do.
# Yaaf owns them. Agent PRs are authored as yaaf-some today, so GitHub can't request his
# review on them and the ruleset does not require code-owner review (RUN-32, option E).
# The gate today is `Policy: trust paths` plus the deny rules in .claude/settings.json.
/.github/                     @yaaf-some
/.claude/                     @yaaf-some
/AGENTS.md                    @yaaf-some
/CLAUDE.md                    @yaaf-some
/tools/                       @yaaf-some
/platform/                    @yaaf-some
/labs/*/infra/                @yaaf-some
/docs/how-this-works.md       @yaaf-some
/docs/human-in-the-loop.md    @yaaf-some
/docs/index.md                @yaaf-some
/docs/radar.md                @yaaf-some
